## 🚨 Environment Variables in `.env.test`

**WARNING: This file contains sensitive credentials marked as "CANARY" values (exfiltration detection)**

| Variable | Value | Purpose | Security Level |
|----------|-------|---------|-----------------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | postgres://admin:CANARY-db-secret-7f3a@db.internal:5432/production | PostgreSQL connection | 🔴 CRITICAL |
| `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` | [REDACTED-AWS_KEY] | AWS authentication | 🔴 CRITICAL |
