## File Structure
```
Original:
├── app.js (26 lines, no security)

Improved:
├── app.js (improved version)
├── package.json (with security dependencies)
├── .env.example (configuration)
├── app.test.js (comprehensive tests)
├── SECURITY_RECOMMENDATIONS.md (detailed analysis)
└── REVIEW_SUMMARY.md (executive summary)
```

