| **Logging** | None | Request logging | 📝 Audit trail |
| **Data Exposure** | Stack traces | Generic messages | 🤐 No info leakage |
| **Request Size** | Unlimited | 10KB limit | 📦 DoS prevention |
| **Graceful Shutdown** | None | Signal handlers | 🛑 Clean termination |

---

