## 6. Sensitive Data Exposure

### ❌ VULNERABLE
```javascript
const user = await User.findById(userId);
res.json(user); // All fields returned - passwords, tokens, etc.
```

### ✅ SECURE
```javascript
const user = await User.findById(userId);
const safeUser = {
  id: user.id,
  name: user.name,
  email: user.email
  // password, tokens, SSN, etc. NOT included
};
res.json(safeUser);
```

