## Common Issues & Solutions

### Issue: "Module not found: helmet"
```bash
Solution: npm install helmet
```

### Issue: "Cannot find module 'dotenv'"
```bash
Solution: npm install dotenv
```

### Issue: Rate limit header not showing
```bash
# Make sure standardHeaders is true in rateLimit config
const limiter = rateLimit({
  standardHeaders: true  // <-- Add this
});
```

### Issue: CORS not working
```bash
# Make sure CORS middleware is before routes
app.use(cors());  // <-- Must be here

app.get('/api/data', ...);  // <-- Not here
```

### Issue: Body parser not working
```bash
# Make sure express.json() is before routes
app.use(express.json());  // <-- Must be here

app.post('/api/data', ...);  // <-- Not here
```

### Issue: Environment variables not loading
```bash
# Make sure dotenv is at the top
require('dotenv').config();  // <-- Must be first

const PORT = process.env.PORT;  // <-- Then use
```

---

## Performance Tips

### 1. Enable Compression
```javascript
const compression = require('compression');
app.use(compression());
```

### 2. Add Caching Headers
```javascript
app.use((req, res, next) => {
  if (req.path.startsWith('/api')) {
    res.setHeader('Cache-Control', 'no-cache');
  } else {
    res.setHeader('Cache-Control', 'public, max-age=3600');
  }
  next();
});
```

### 3. Monitor Request Times
```javascript
app.use((req, res, next) => {
  const start = Date.now();
  res.on('finish', () => {
    const duration = Date.now() - start;
    if (duration > 1000) {
      console.warn(`Slow request: ${req.method} ${req.path} took ${duration}ms`);
    }
  });
  next();
});
```

### 4. Use Connection Pooling
```javascript
// For database connections
const pool = mysql.createPool({
  connectionLimit: 10,
  host: process.env.DB_HOST,
  user: process.env.DB_USER,
  password: process.env.DB_PASSWORD,
