```

---

## Deployment Checklist

- [ ] Set `NODE_ENV=production`
- [ ] Use appropriate values for rate limiting
- [ ] Configure `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` for your domain
- [ ] Enable HTTPS/TLS
- [ ] Use a reverse proxy (nginx)
- [ ] Implement logging to a centralized system
