## 📋 Code Review Checklist

When reviewing security in Express apps, check for:

- [ ] **Input Validation**
  - [ ] All query params validated
  - [ ] All route params validated
  - [ ] All body fields validated
  - [ ] Type checking performed
  - [ ] Range/length checking enforced

- [ ] **Error Handling**
  - [ ] Try-catch blocks present
  - [ ] All async operations wrapped
