# Security Review: app.js Improvements

## Summary of Issues Found

| Issue | Severity | Impact |
|-------|----------|--------|
| No security headers | High | Vulnerable to clickjacking, XSS, MIME sniffing |
| Missing rate limiting | High | DoS vulnerability |
| No input validation | High | Query injection attacks |
| No error handling | High | Information disclosure, server crashes |
| No request logging | Medium | No audit trail for debugging/compliance |
| Missing data sanitization | Medium | NoSQL injection risk |
| Exposing sensitive data | Medium | Privacy concerns (emails) |
| No size limits on requests | Medium | Memory exhaustion attacks |

