## 🚫 What NOT to Do

| ❌ DON'T | ✅ DO |
|----------|-------|
| Store passwords in plaintext | Use bcrypt or argon2 |
| Log passwords or tokens | Filter sensitive data |
| Expose stack traces in production | Log internally only |
| Trust user input | Validate everything |
| Use hardcoded secrets | Use environment variables |
| Store secrets in git | Add to .gitignore |
| Skip HTTPS | Always use HTTPS |
| Combine auth headers | Use standard format |
| Return all database fields | Return only needed fields |
| Disable CORS completely | Configure whitelist |
| No rate limiting | Implement rate limits |
| Concatenate SQL queries | Use parameterized queries |

