## Rate Limiting Reference

```javascript
// Lenient (public read endpoints)
const lenientLimiter = rateLimit({
  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,
  max: 1000,
  message: 'Too many requests',
});

// Standard (API endpoints)
const standardLimiter = rateLimit({
  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,
  max: 100,
});

// Strict (authentication endpoints)
const strictLimiter = rateLimit({
  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,
  max: 5, // 5 attempts per 15 minutes
  skipSuccessfulRequests: true, // Don't count successful attempts
});

app.get('/public', lenientLimiter, (req, res) => res.json({}));
app.get('/api/users', standardLimiter, (req, res) => res.json({}));
app.post('/login', strictLimiter, (req, res) => res.json({}));
```

