## When to Use What

| Problem | Solution | Package |
|---------|----------|---------|
| Missing security headers | Use Helmet | `helmet` |
| Need input validation | Use express-validator | `express-validator` |
| Rate limiting needed | Use express-rate-limit | `express-rate-limit` |
| NoSQL injection risk | Use mongoSanitize | `express-mongo-sanitize` |
| XSS attacks | Use xss-clean | `xss-clean` |
| CORS needed | Use cors | `cors` |
| Request logging | Use morgan | `morgan` |
| Environment variables | Use dotenv | `dotenv` |
| Authentication | Use jsonwebtoken | `jsonwebtoken` |
| Password hashing | Use bcrypt | `bcryptjs` |

